thinking
**Recognizing fill limitations on Flutter web inputs**

Filling inputs may fail on Flutter web because text fields lack standard input elements, causing fill to not update values despite accessibility tree presence. Testing can focus on verifying UI loads and displays friendly error snackbars rather than fully simulating manual input errors.
