**Deciding which untracked files to keep or remove**

Untracked temp files in .ralph/.tmp and large untracked directories like dev-browser node_modules should be removed to avoid unwanted commits, while run logs may be kept and committed since they reflect progress; .gitignore doesn’t cover these, so manual cleanup is needed.
